n\n【位置:右　距離:近い】\n「……くすぐったいでしょ？　そろそろ起きなさ〜い？」\n\n「こちょこちょこちょこちょっ♪」\n\n「こ〜ちょこちょこちょこちょこちょ〜♪」\n\n【位置:真ん中　距離:普通】\n「……起きた起きた」\n\n「全くもぅ。きみ、イタズラされるの好きだよねぇ」\n\n「寝たフリでしょ？　い・つ・も・の♪」\n\n「そういうとこ、ほんっと可愛いんだから」\n\n「だから次は……もっとすごいイタズラ、しちゃうかもね？　ふふふっ♪」\n\n〜〜〜\n以上です。\n\n是非とも、演じていただけると嬉しいです！\nよろしくお願いします！", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [{"path": "/@Hermit_Heaven/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "novel", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1203863, "client_id": 2552612, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0cfd82d9/uploads/origins/84140c94-6afb-46d7-917f-7cb030d00c00?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2cab6666fe247760e5df679ebe455b6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0cfd82d9/uploads/origins/84140c94-6afb-46d7-917f-7cb030d00c00?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2cab6666fe247760e5df679ebe455b6, https://si.imgix.net/0cfd82d9/uploads/origins/84140c94-6afb-46d7-917f-7cb030d00c00?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=112a84d28c67168009d9f9e2347b750b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0cfd82d9/uploads/origins/84140c94-6afb-46d7-917f-7cb030d00c00?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7451beeda819f19bdaec6fa14815489c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0cfd82d9/uploads/origins/84140c94-6afb-46d7-917f-7cb030d00c00?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ff3a9c564372cf9b9c82d98328bd4a54", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0cfd82d9/uploads/origins/84140c94-6afb-46d7-917f-7cb030d00c00?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ff3a9c564372cf9b9c82d98328bd4a54, https://si.imgix.net/0cfd82d9/uploads/origins/84140c94-6afb-46d7-917f-7cb030d00c00?bg=%23ff